@startuml
title ioScope Logical Class View - Qt MVC Slice
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

package "Bootstrap and CLI" {
  class ioScopeShell
  class ioFileComparator
}

package "Qt MVC" {
  abstract class ioOscilloscopeView
  class ioCompactOscilloscopeView
  class ioDetailedOscilloscopeView
  interface ioOscilloscopeWindow
  class ioQtScopeWindow
  class ioTkOscilloscopeWindow <<legacy>>
  class ioOscilloscopeController
  class ioOscilloscopeModel
  class ioControlState
  class ioViewportState
  class ioRenderState
  class ioScopeSettingsStore
}

package "Signal Flow Context" {
  class ioFilterPipeline
  class ioWaveformGenerator
}

package "Theme Hierarchy" {
  abstract class ioViewTheme
  class ioPortraitTheme
  class ioLandscapeTheme
}

package "Live Session Context" {
  class ioLiveOscilloscopeSession
}

ioScopeShell ..> ioOscilloscopeController : starts / restores state
ioScopeShell ..> ioScopeSettingsStore : loads / saves settings

ioCompactOscilloscopeView --|> ioOscilloscopeView
ioDetailedOscilloscopeView --|> ioOscilloscopeView
ioTkOscilloscopeWindow ..> ioOscilloscopeWindow : legacy host contract
ioQtScopeWindow o--> ioCompactOscilloscopeView : hosts compact view
ioQtScopeWindow o--> ioDetailedOscilloscopeView : hosts detailed view
ioQtScopeWindow o--> ioOscilloscopeController : forwards UI events to
ioOscilloscopeController o--> ioOscilloscopeModel : updates / queries model
ioOscilloscopeController o--> ioOscilloscopeView : notifies active views
ioOscilloscopeController ..> ioRenderState : builds render snapshot
ioOscilloscopeController o--> ioLiveOscilloscopeSession : starts / stops live session
ioOscilloscopeModel o--> ioControlState : stores controls
ioOscilloscopeModel o--> ioViewportState : stores viewport
ioOscilloscopeModel o--> ioFilterPipeline : applies filters
ioOscilloscopeModel o--> ioWaveformGenerator : refreshes samples from
ioOscilloscopeView o--> ioViewTheme : theme

ioPortraitTheme --|> ioViewTheme
ioLandscapeTheme --|> ioViewTheme

note right of ioOscilloscopeView
Primary MVC rule:
one abstract View boundary only.
Both selectable Qt UIs inherit this class.
end note

note right of ioQtScopeWindow
Qt host shell only.
It switches between concrete view instances
and is not a second View abstraction.
end note

note bottom of ioTkOscilloscopeWindow
Legacy compatibility path only.
It is documented honestly but is not part of
the primary Qt submission path.
end note
@enduml
